      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOMERTON ANN (1) turned in a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 350m behind Dr. Burma (20.48) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Should bounce back. WEIRD KAREN (4) was safely held last time out, finishing eighth at Warragul over 460m behind Green Frog Cafe (27.64) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from five starts. Expected to give a good account. DR. NATASHA (8) drew an outside box and was game in defeat when only one length from the winner Brindle Motion in third(25.19) at Sale. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Likely to be in the finish again. BEST DRESSED (3) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
